    tests: stage Founder policy in the remaining cycle-invoking fixtures
    
    Same cause as the previous commit, five more fixtures: each builds a temp town
    and runs a real government/*-cycle.sh, which requires
    government/AGENT-REPORTING-POLICY.md (and executive-cycle.sh reads
    delivery-candidates.py). Neither was staged, so they failed on
    'Viche: mandatory Founder agent policy missing'.
    
    Dependencies staged only; assertions unchanged.
    executive-cycle, institutional-recovery, oversight, recovery-steward now pass.
    
    NOT fixed here, deliberately: innovation-centre-smoke still fails, but for a
    different, semantic reason — it models the pre-Act-24 legislative office while
    enacted LAWS.md makes branch-health.sh read the executive office path. Staging
    LAWS.md there 'fixed' the grep but broke office identification, so I reverted it
    rather than paper over a real fixture/law mismatch.

